# ConvertScan Design System
**Version:** 2.0 — Linear/Vercel/Resend aesthetic  
**Owner:** Vega  
**Target:** Koda implementation  
**Date:** 2026-04-17

Aesthetic: dark-first, 95% monochrome + single electric-blue accent, dense, premium typography, 150ms motion. Reference tier: Linear, Vercel dashboard, Resend, dub.co.

---

## 1. Color Tokens

### Accent color selection

**Chosen accent: Electric Indigo — oklch(62% 0.21 264) / #5e6ad2**

Rationale: CROBOT is a CRO scoring tool. Its output is analytical, data-dense, confidence-driving. Electric indigo (Linear's exact brand hue) signals precision and trust — the same psychological register as dev tooling and B2B SaaS. Competitors in the CRO space (Hotjar orange, Crazy Egg red) own warm hues. Indigo differentiates while feeling enterprise-grade. It also passes 4.5:1 contrast on dark surfaces at the specified lightness. Vercel white-on-black is too neutral for a product with scoring + severity. Red/green are already consumed by the semantic score system. Indigo is the only safe accent that doesn't collide.

### Full `globals.css` replacement

Replace the entire `@theme inline` block and `.dark {}` block with the following. Also delete the `@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?...')` line on line 1 — Inter is loaded via `next/font` in `layout.tsx`.

```css
@import "tailwindcss";
@import "tw-animate-css";

@custom-variant dark (&:is(.dark *));

@theme inline {
  /* ─── Accent ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  --color-accent-brand: oklch(62% 0.21 264);        /* #5e6ad2 — electric indigo */
  --color-accent-brand-subtle: oklch(62% 0.21 264 / 0.12);
  --color-accent-brand-emphasis: oklch(55% 0.22 264); /* hover/pressed */
  --color-accent-brand-foreground: oklch(100% 0 0);

  /* ─── Background layers — Light ──────────────────────────── */
  --color-canvas: oklch(99% 0 0);           /* page background */
  --color-surface: oklch(100% 0 0);         /* card / panel */
  --color-surface-raised: oklch(97% 0.005 220); /* elevated card */
  --color-overlay: oklch(100% 0 0);         /* dialog / popover */

  /* ─── Foreground — Light ──────────────────────────────────── */
  --color-fg-primary: oklch(11% 0.013 220);   /* headings, body */
  --color-fg-secondary: oklch(38% 0.009 220); /* labels, captions */
  --color-fg-tertiary: oklch(55% 0.007 220);  /* placeholders, hints */
  --color-fg-disabled: oklch(72% 0.005 220);

  /* ─── Border — Light ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  --color-border-subtle: oklch(95% 0.006 220);
  --color-border-default: oklch(91% 0.010 220);
  --color-border-strong: oklch(78% 0.010 220);

  /* ─── Semantic — shared across light/dark via relative values */

  /* Success */
  --color-success-subtle: oklch(97% 0.025 145);
  --color-success-default: oklch(56% 0.19 145);   /* #22c55e equiv */
  --color-success-emphasis: oklch(48% 0.19 145);
  --color-success-fg: oklch(30% 0.14 145);

  /* Warning */
  --color-warning-subtle: oklch(97% 0.030 75);
  --color-warning-default: oklch(65% 0.18 72);    /* #f59e0b equiv */
  --color-warning-emphasis: oklch(57% 0.19 72);
  --color-warning-fg: oklch(35% 0.14 72);

  /* Danger */
  --color-danger-subtle: oklch(97% 0.025 27);
  --color-danger-default: oklch(51% 0.22 27);     /* #ef4444 equiv */
  --color-danger-emphasis: oklch(44% 0.22 27);
  --color-danger-fg: oklch(30% 0.18 27);

  /* Info */
  --color-info-subtle: oklch(97% 0.018 230);
  --color-info-default: oklch(58% 0.18 230);
  --color-info-emphasis: oklch(50% 0.18 230);
  --color-info-fg: oklch(30% 0.14 230);

  /* ─── Scan state colors ───────────────────────────────────── */
  --color-scan-pending: oklch(55% 0.007 220);     /* neutral grey */
  --color-scan-running: oklch(62% 0.21 264);      /* accent indigo */
  --color-scan-completed: oklch(56% 0.19 145);    /* success green */
  --color-scan-failed: oklch(51% 0.22 27);        /* danger red */

  /* ─── shadcn token aliases (light defaults) ──────────────── */
  --color-background: var(--color-canvas);
  --color-foreground: var(--color-fg-primary);
  --color-card: var(--color-surface);
  --color-card-foreground: var(--color-fg-primary);
  --color-popover: var(--color-overlay);
  --color-popover-foreground: var(--color-fg-primary);
  --color-primary: var(--color-accent-brand);
  --color-primary-foreground: var(--color-accent-brand-foreground);
  --color-secondary: oklch(95% 0.006 220);
  --color-secondary-foreground: var(--color-fg-primary);
  --color-muted: oklch(96% 0.006 220);
  --color-muted-foreground: var(--color-fg-secondary);
  --color-accent: oklch(95% 0.006 220);
  --color-accent-foreground: var(--color-fg-primary);
  --color-destructive: var(--color-danger-default);
  --color-destructive-foreground: oklch(100% 0 0);
  --color-border: var(--color-border-default);
  --color-input: var(--color-border-default);
  --color-ring: var(--color-accent-brand);

  /* ─── Sidebar tokens ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  --sidebar: oklch(11% 0.025 222);
  --sidebar-background: oklch(11% 0.025 222);
  --sidebar-foreground: oklch(52% 0.010 220);
  --sidebar-foreground-active: oklch(95% 0.005 220);
  --sidebar-primary: var(--color-accent-brand);
  --sidebar-primary-foreground: oklch(100% 0 0);
  --sidebar-accent: oklch(17% 0.020 222);          /* hover bg */
  --sidebar-accent-foreground: oklch(80% 0.008 220);
  --sidebar-border: oklch(17% 0.018 222);
  --sidebar-ring: var(--color-accent-brand);
  --sidebar-width: 15rem;                          /* 240px — Linear-style */
  --sidebar-width-mobile: 17rem;
  --sidebar-width-icon: 3.5rem;                    /* 56px collapsed */

  --color-sidebar: var(--sidebar);
  --color-sidebar-foreground: var(--sidebar-foreground);
  --color-sidebar-primary: var(--sidebar-primary);
  --color-sidebar-primary-foreground: var(--sidebar-primary-foreground);
  --color-sidebar-accent: var(--sidebar-accent);
  --color-sidebar-accent-foreground: var(--sidebar-accent-foreground);
  --color-sidebar-border: var(--sidebar-border);
