## 8. Page Compositions

**Dashboard:** Hero score ring (180px) + plan badge in a top card spanning full width. 4 KPI cards in a row (2 on mobile). Recent scans table (default density, 5 rows, link to all). Compact activity feed in a sidebar column at lg+. Mobile: score card → 2 KPI → table.

**Scan:** Single centered card (max-w-lg) with URL input + device toggle + CTA button. During scan: card morphs into terminal-style streaming log panel (monospace, dark bg, severity left-border, auto-scroll). Progress bar above terminal showing % complete.

**Reports list:** Dense table (default density). Columns: URL (truncated 30ch), Score (ScoreRing mini 48px), Status (StatusBadge), Date, Actions. Filter chips row above table (All / Completed / Failed / date range). Pagination below. No cards.

**Report detail:** Top: hero ScoreRing (180px) + domain + date + rescan button in a card. Below: 7 pillar cards in a 2-col grid (lg: 3-col). Below pillars: findings section with horizontal-scroll tab bar (Critical / High / Medium / Low / All). Each finding row opens a right Sheet drawer with full detail.

**Settings:** Left subnav (200px, same nav pattern as sidebar) with items: Profile, Billing, API Keys, Notifications, Team (pro+). Right: content area. No tabs — only left nav selection changes the content pane. Each section is a Card.

**Admin dashboard:** Left 2/3 — activity feed (timestamp + actor + action + resource, 36px rows). Right 1/3 — KPI stack (4 metric cards stacked). Below full width: chart row (2 charts side by side). No dual-column KPI grid.

