## 10. Implementation Order for Koda

Dependencies flow top-to-bottom. Steps at the same level can run in parallel.

```
Step 1 (blocking — everything depends on this)
  └── Update app/globals.css — replace @theme inline + .dark {} as specified
  └── Update tailwind.config.ts — fontSize scale, extend colors with new vars
  └── Update app/layout.tsx — add Geist Mono font, remove Google Fonts import

Step 2 (parallel, all depend on Step 1 tokens)
  ├── Update components/ui/button.tsx — new sizes, radius-md, duration-150
  ├── Update components/ui/card.tsx — rounded-lg, shadow-xs, p-4 default
  ├── Update components/ui/input.tsx — h-9, rounded-md, new focus ring
  ├── Update components/ui/badge.tsx — new variants using semantic vars
  └── Update components/ui/progress.tsx — height variants h-0.5/h-1/h-1.5

Step 3 (parallel, depends on Step 2 primitives)
  ├── Create components/shared/StatusBadge.tsx
  ├── Create components/shared/EmptyState.tsx (replace existing if present)
  ├── Create components/shared/KpiCard.tsx (unified, replaces both)
  └── Update lib/score-utils.ts — getScoreColor() using CSS vars

Step 4 (depends on Step 3)
  ├── Update components/shared/ScoreRing.tsx — hero/pillar/mini variants, CSS var colors
  └── Update components/app/sidebar/AppSidebar.tsx — groups, new token classes, h-9 items

Step 5 (depends on Step 4 — page-level, all parallel)
  ├── Update all chart files — replace hardcoded hex with CSS var hook
  ├── Audit all pages for bg-white/bg-slate/border-slate/text-[Npx] — bulk replace
  └── Add Command palette (Cmd+K) — new component using cmdk

Step 6 (final — depends on Step 5)
  └── Visual review at 375/768/1280/1920 × light/dark
      Grep audit: rg '#[0-9a-fA-F]{3,6}' components/ — expect 0 results in app code
      Grep audit: rg 'bg-white|bg-slate|border-slate|text-gray' components/ — expect 0
      Grep audit: rg 'rounded-2xl|rounded-3xl' components/ — expect 0
```

Total: 6 sequential steps, 3 steps with internal parallelism. Steps 2/3/5 are the bulk of the work — those can be split across multiple Koda runs by section.
